#. type: Title =
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "git-request-pull(1)"
msgstr "git-request-pull(1)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:7
msgid "git-request-pull - Generates a summary of pending changes"
msgstr "git-request-pull - プルリクエスト文面生成(Generates a summary of pending changes)"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:12
msgid "'git request-pull' [-p] <start> <URL> [<end>]"
msgstr "'git request-pull' [-p] <start> <URL> [<end>]"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:20
msgid ""
"Generate a request asking your upstream project to pull changes into their "
"tree.  The request, printed to the standard output, begins with the branch "
"description, summarizes the changes, and indicates from where they can be "
"pulled."
msgstr "上流(upstream)プロジェクトに対して、 上流プロジェクトのツリーに変更を取り込むよう依頼するリクエストを生成します。 このリクエストは標準出力に表示され、 ブランチの説明から始まり、 変更の概要をまとめ、 どこから変更を取り込めるかを示します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:25
msgid ""
"The upstream project is expected to have the commit named by `<start>` and "
"the output asks it to integrate the changes you made since that commit, up "
"to the commit named by `<end>`, by visiting the repository named by `<URL>`."
msgstr "上流プロジェクトには  `<start>` という名前のコミットがあると予想され、出力では、そのコミット以降に行った変更を `<URL>` という名前のリポジトリーの、`<end>` という名前のコミットまで統合するように求められます。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "`-p`"
msgstr "`-p`"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:31
msgid "Include patch text in the output."
msgstr "出力にパッチテキストを含めます。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "<start>"
msgstr "<start>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:35
msgid ""
"Commit to start at.  This names a commit that is already in the upstream "
"history."
msgstr "開始コミット。これは、すでに上流の履歴に存在するコミットを指定します。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "<URL>"
msgstr "<URL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:38
msgid "The repository URL to be pulled from."
msgstr "プル元のリポジトリURL。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "<end>"
msgstr "<end>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:42
msgid ""
"Commit to end at (defaults to HEAD).  This names the commit at the tip of "
"the history you are asking to be pulled."
msgstr ""
"終了コミット(省略時デフォルトはHEAD)。プルを要求している履歴の先端にあるコ"
"ミットを指定します。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:47
msgid ""
"When the repository named by `<URL>` has the commit at a tip of a ref that "
"is different from the ref you have locally, you can use the `<local>:"
"<remote>` syntax, to have its local name, a colon `:`, and its remote name."
msgstr ""
"`<URL>` で指定されたリポジトリの、ローカルにあるrefとは異なるrefの先端にコ"
"ミットがある場合、「ローカル名 コロン(:) リモート名」である、 `<local>:"
"<remote>` 構文を使用することができます。"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr "EXAMPLES"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:56
msgid ""
"Imagine that you built your work on your `master` branch on top of the "
"`v1.0` release, and want it to be integrated into the project.  First you "
"push that change to your public repository for others to see:"
msgstr "あなたが master ブランチで v1.0 リリースを基盤に作業を進め、 その変更をプロジェクトに統合したいとします。 まずは、 その変更を公開リポジトリーにプッシュして、 他の人に見えるようにします:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "\tgit push https://git.ko.xz/project master\n"
msgstr "\tgit push https://git.ko.xz/project master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:60
msgid "Then, you run this command:"
msgstr "それから、あなたは以下のコマンドを実行します:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "\tgit request-pull v1.0 https://git.ko.xz/project master\n"
msgstr "\tgit request-pull v1.0 https://git.ko.xz/project master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:66
msgid ""
"which will produce a request to the upstream, summarizing the changes "
"between the `v1.0` release and your `master`, to pull it from your public "
"repository."
msgstr "これにより、上流へのリクエストが生成され、 `v1.0` リリースと `master` の間の変更が要約されて、公開リポジトリーからプルされます。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:69
msgid ""
"If you pushed your change to a branch whose name is different from the one "
"you have locally, e.g."
msgstr ""
"ローカルにあるブランチとは名前が異なるブランチに変更をプッシュする場合、例え"
"ば、"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "\tgit push https://git.ko.xz/project master:for-linus\n"
msgstr "\tgit push https://git.ko.xz/project master:for-linus\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:73
msgid "then you can ask that to be pulled with"
msgstr "それからあなたはそれをプルするように頼むことができます"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "\tgit request-pull v1.0 https://git.ko.xz/project master:for-linus\n"
msgstr "\tgit request-pull v1.0 https://git.ko.xz/project master:for-linus\n"

#. type: Title -
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "GIT"
msgstr "GIT"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../Documentation-sedout/git-request-pull.txt:79
msgid "Part of the linkgit:git[1] suite"
msgstr "Part of the linkgit:git[1] suite"
